IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ARITH-LOOP.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INDEX PIC 9(02) VALUE 1.
01 WS-COUNT PIC 9(02) VALUE 5.
01 WS-PRICE PIC 9(03)V99 VALUE 12.50.
01 WS-QTY PIC 9(03) VALUE 1.
01 WS-LINE PIC 9(05)V99.
01 WS-TOTAL PIC 9(07)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-DISCOUNT PIC 9(02)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-TOTAL-EDIT PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
PERFORM VARYING WS-INDEX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-INDEX > WS-COUNT
    COMPUTE WS-LINE = WS-PRICE * WS-QTY
    ADD WS-LINE TO WS-TOTAL
    ADD 1 TO WS-QTY
END-PERFORM
PERFORM APPLY-DISCOUNT
MOVE WS-TOTAL TO WS-TOTAL-EDIT
DISPLAY 'Subtotal: ' WS-TOTAL-EDIT
DISPLAY 'Discount: ' WS-DISCOUNT
COMPUTE WS-TOTAL = WS-TOTAL - WS-DISCOUNT
MOVE WS-TOTAL TO WS-TOTAL-EDIT
DISPLAY 'Grand total: ' WS-TOTAL-EDIT
GOBACK.
APPLY-DISCOUNT.
EVALUATE TRUE
WHEN WS-TOTAL >= 100.00
    MOVE 5.00 TO WS-DISCOUNT
WHEN WS-TOTAL >= 50.00
    MOVE 2.00 TO WS-DISCOUNT
WHEN OTHER
    MOVE 0.00 TO WS-DISCOUNT
END-EVALUATE.